    "notes": "The Qualla photos were screened first. The apparent public-domain mark on an interior photograph applies to the older stained glass, and the photographer uses CC BY-SA. The selected images are the two full leaves of the 24 November 1915 published plate from the University of Toronto copy. The engraved church, proposed tower and ground plan support the reconstruction, and the consecration record establishes that the tower was later built."
